        "TileImage": "$($repository 73de0748-7563-462e-ac5f-6505611799f3).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47.  Our client, a respected MTG player, needs two of his competitors taken down.\r\rYour first target is Josh &apos;Sky&apos; Sykes. A prodigy, who&apos;s innovated and mastered a completely new way of utilising Flying keyword in Green-White decks.\r\rSecond job, Terry Norfolk, is a veteran MTG player, a master in his craft. He is a notorious Merfolk abuser, well known and despised for his degeneracy.\r\rOur client wants to send a message to the community and we are responsible for the delivery. Good luck 47.",
